@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade DevOps - Evidencia Docker y limite del renderizado documental

package "Artefactos de tiempo de ejecucion de aplicacion buscados" as AppArtifacts EZ_RISK {
  component "Dockerfile\nno encontrado" as DockerfileMissing
  component "docker-compose.yml/.yaml\nno encontrado" as ComposeMissing
  component "configuracion Nginx / Traefik\nno encontrada" as ProxyMissing
  component "Kubernetes / Helm / Terraform\nno encontrado" as IaCMissing
}

package "Herramientas documentales anadidas" as DocsTooling EZ_DEVOPS {
  component "render-diagrams.sh" as BashScript
  component "render-diagrams.ps1" as PsScript
  component "PlantUML Docker image\nplantuml/plantuml:latest" as PlantumlImage
  folder "plantuml/" as PumlFolders
  folder "rendered/\nPNG + SVG" as RenderedFolders
}

PumlFolders --> BashScript
PumlFolders --> PsScript
BashScript --> PlantumlImage : docker run
PsScript --> PlantumlImage : docker run
PlantumlImage --> RenderedFolders : renderiza diagramas

note right of AppArtifacts
El repositorio no define contenedores de aplicacion.
Por tanto, no se afirma ninguna topologia de despliegue ni de servicios Docker.
end note

note bottom
Docker se usa en este entregable solo como renderizador PlantUML reproducible.
Esto es independiente de la contenedorizacion de la aplicacion.
end note

@enduml
